id conflate
name Conflate
appeared 2026
tags pl
website https://hacker-lot.github.io/conflate/
description Conflate is an experimental polyglot programming language that combines Python, C++, Rust, Java, and Go blocks in one program, with shared values and optional typed inputs and outputs.
fileExtensions confl
writtenIn python
isOpenSource true
gitRepo https://github.com/Hacker-lot/conflate
